  "meta": {
    "title": "Suo-nada collision, 27 November 2025",
    "description": "Oil tanker Seitoku Maru, westbound, and the pushing unit Spinner 2 (pusher plus barge), eastbound, collided off Nojima in the Suo-nada at about 18:13 local time. Both AIS tracks are reproduced from the appendix tables of the JTSB report. The report's own analysis records that the officer of the watch on the tanker saw a white light and a green light when he first sighted the pushing unit - which is what the light arcs in this scenario produce.",
